        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-2097] After receiving the SessionSetupRes with ResponseCode equal to \"OK\", the EVCC shall send the proper AC_ChargeParameterDiscoveryReq while V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Timer is smaller than V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Time, in case the EVCC resumes a previously paused V2G communication session.",
