        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1596] If EVCC is using ServiceName = AC or AC_BPT in Table 204, after receiving the ScheduleExchangeRes with \"ResponseCode = OK\", and EVSEProcessing set to \"Finished\", the EVCC shall send a PowerDeliveryReq within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 215.",
