        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "[V2G20-1437] If EVCC uses ServiceName = AC or AC_ACDP or AC_BPT or AC_ACD_BPT from Table 204, after receiving the PowerDeliveryRes with \"ResponseCode = OK\" or \"ResponseCode = WARNING_PowerToleranceNotConfirmed\", the EVCC shall send an AC_ChargeLoopReq within V2G_EVCC_Sequence_Performance_Timeout according to Table 216 to start the energy transfer, a schedule renegotiation or to enter a standby period.",
            "block_bbox": [
